        "description": "Requires BOTH cookies AND X-Habitat-CSRF, all from the same control login. If Origin is sent, it must equal the Pi request origin; SaaS backends should not forward browser Origin. 202 means asynchronous acceptance only. Poll GET status; actual_ir_on is always null. Continuous ON continues until explicit OFF, interruption or worker failure; closing the browser or logging out does not stop it. Pi renews the short MCU lease while active; loss of renewal makes the MCU turn OFF after the current lease (up to about 5 seconds). Reconnection does not automatically restart ON. A timeout may occur after acceptance: never automatically replay ON. Reconcile status first. Explicit OFF may be retried with bounded backoff. There is no idempotency-key contract.",
